{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def _calculate_digit_sum(substring_content: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of digit characters in a string.\n    Non-digit characters are ignored.\"\"\"\n    digit_sum = 0\n    for char in substring_content:\n        if '0' <= char <= '9':\n            digit_sum += int(char)\n    return digit_sum\ndef count_Substrings(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts substrings where the sum of digits equals their length.\n    It iterates through all possible substrings.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(s)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_substring = s[i : j + 1]\n            substring_length = len(current_substring)\n            digit_sum = _calculate_digit_sum(current_substring)\n\n            if digit_sum == substring_length:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
