{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_newman_conway_memo = {}\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth Newman-Conway number using memoization.\n    It returns the corresponding integer value for n.\"\"\"\n    if n in _newman_conway_memo:\n        return _newman_conway_memo[n]\n\n    if n == 1 or n == 2:\n        result = 1\n    else:\n        pn_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n        result = sequence(pn_minus_1) + sequence(n - pn_minus_1)\n\n    _newman_conway_memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
