{"task_id": "Mbpp/101", "solution": "class KthElementError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"Base exception for Kth Element Finder errors.\"\"\"\n    pass\nclass InvalidIndexError(KthElementError):\n    \"\"\"Raised when the provided index k is not a positive integer.\"\"\"\n    pass\nclass IndexOutOfBoundsError(KthElementError):\n    \"\"\"Raised when the provided index k is outside the array's bounds.\"\"\"\n    pass\ndef kth_element(array: list, k: int):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the element at the 1-based index k in the given array.\n    This function validates k to be positive and within array bounds.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(k, int) or k <= 0:\n        raise InvalidIndexError(f\"Index k must be a positive integer, got {k}.\")\n\n    if k > len(array):\n        raise IndexOutOfBoundsError(f\"Index k ({k}) is out of bounds for array of length {len(array)}.\")\n\n    # Convert 1-based index to 0-based index\n    zero_based_index = k - 1\n    return array[zero_based_index]"}
