{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(numbers: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zeroes to non-zero integers in an array.\n    Returns 0.0 if there are no non-zero elements to form a ratio with.\n    \"\"\"\n    zero_count_val = 0\n    non_zero_count_val = 0\n\n    for element in numbers:\n        if element == 0:\n            zero_count_val += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_count_val += 1\n\n    if non_zero_count_val == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    else:\n        return float(zero_count_val) / non_zero_count_val"}
