{"task_id": "Mbpp/120", "solution": "def max_product_tuple(list_of_tuples: list[tuple[float, float]]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum absolute product between numbers in pairs of tuples within a given list.\n    Returns 0.0 if the input list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_absolute_product = 0.0\n\n    if not list_of_tuples:\n        return 0.0\n\n    for element1, element2 in list_of_tuples:\n        product = element1 * element2\n        absolute_product = abs(product)\n        if absolute_product > max_absolute_product:\n            max_absolute_product = absolute_product\n\n    return max_absolute_product"}
