{"task_id": "Mbpp/170", "solution": "def sum_range_list(numbers: list, startIndex: int, endIndex: int):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of numbers within a specified range in a list.\n    Returns 0 if the list is empty or if the indices define an invalid range.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not numbers:\n        return 0\n\n    list_length = len(numbers)\n\n    if startIndex < 0 or endIndex < 0:\n        return 0\n\n    if startIndex >= list_length or endIndex >= list_length:\n        return 0\n\n    if startIndex > endIndex:\n        return 0\n\n    current_sum = 0\n    for i in range(startIndex, endIndex + 1):\n        current_sum += numbers[i]\n\n    return current_sum"}
