{"task_id": "Mbpp/391", "solution": "def convert_list_dictionary(list1: list, list2: list, list3: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Transforms three input lists into a list of dictionaries with nested structures.\n    Elements are paired by their corresponding indices to form the output.\n    \"\"\"\n    output_list = []\n    for primary_key, nested_key, nested_value in zip(list1, list2, list3):\n        nested_dict = {nested_key: nested_value}\n        outer_dict = {primary_key: nested_dict}\n        output_list.append(outer_dict)\n    return output_list"}
