{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "_perrin_cache = {}\ndef _get_perrin_number(index: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the Perrin number for a given index, using memoization.\"\"\"\n    if index in _perrin_cache:\n        return _perrin_cache[index]\n\n    if index == 0:\n        result = 3\n    elif index == 1:\n        result = 0\n    elif index == 2:\n        result = 2\n    else:\n        result = _get_perrin_number(index - 2) + _get_perrin_number(index - 3)\n\n    _perrin_cache[index] = result\n    return result\ndef cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(n).\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        total_sum += _get_perrin_number(i)\n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/447", "solution": "def cube_nums(numbers: list[float | int]) -> list[float | int]:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the cube of each element in an input list and returns a new list of cubed values.\n    The order of elements is maintained from the input list.\"\"\"\n    result_list = []\n    for element in numbers:\n        cubed_value = element * element * element\n        result_list.append(cubed_value)\n    return result_list"}
