{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all even factors of a given integer n.\n    Handles n=0 or n=1 by returning 0, otherwise iterates up to the square root of n.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0 or n == 1:\n        return 0\n\n    sum_even_factors = 0\n    absolute_n = abs(n)\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= absolute_n:\n        if absolute_n % i == 0:  # i is a factor\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                sum_even_factors += i\n\n            j = absolute_n // i\n            if i * i != absolute_n:  # Check if j is a distinct factor\n                if j % 2 == 0:\n                    sum_even_factors += j\n        i += 1\n    return sum_even_factors"}
