{"task_id": "Mbpp/583", "solution": "def catalan_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth Catalan number using the combinatorial formula C_n = (2n)! / ((n + 1)! * n!).\"\"\"\n\n    # Calculate (2n)!\n    fact_2n = 1\n    for i in range(1, 2 * n + 1):\n        fact_2n *= i\n\n    # Calculate (n + 1)!\n    fact_n_plus_1 = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 2):\n        fact_n_plus_1 *= i\n\n    # Calculate n!\n    fact_n = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        fact_n *= i\n\n    # Perform the integer division to get the Catalan number.\n    return fact_2n // (fact_n_plus_1 * fact_n)"}
