{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "def _binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\n    Returns 0 if k is out of range [0, n].\n    \"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    if k == 0 or k == n:\n        return 1\n    if k > n // 2:\n        k = n - k\n\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(k):\n        res = res * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n    return res\ndef sum_Of_product(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the product of consecutive binomial coefficients.\n    Computes sum_{k=0 to n-1} C(n,k) * C(n, k+1).\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(n):\n        coeff1 = _binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n        coeff2 = _binomial_coefficient(n, k + 1)\n        total_sum += coeff1 * coeff2\n    return total_sum"}
