{"task_id": "Mbpp/594", "solution": "def diff_even_odd(input_list: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the difference between the first even and first odd number found in the list.\n    It iterates to find these numbers and then returns their difference (first even - first odd).\"\"\"\n    first_even = None\n    first_odd = None\n\n    for number in input_list:\n        # If an even number is found and first_even hasn't been set yet\n        if number % 2 == 0 and first_even is None:\n            first_even = number\n        # If an odd number is found and first_odd hasn't been set yet\n        elif number % 2 != 0 and first_odd is None:\n            first_odd = number\n\n        # If both first_even and first_odd have been found, we can stop\n        if first_even is not None and first_odd is not None:\n            break\n\n    return first_even - first_odd"}
