{"task_id": "Mbpp/615", "solution": "def average_tuple(input_data):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average value for each inner tuple within a given tuple of tuples.\n    Returns a list of these calculated averages.\n    \"\"\"\n    averages_list = []\n    for inner_tuple in input_data:\n        if len(inner_tuple) == 0:\n            averages_list.append(0.0)\n        else:\n            # Calculate the average for non-empty inner tuples.\n            avg = sum(inner_tuple) / len(inner_tuple)\n            averages_list.append(float(avg))\n    return averages_list"}
