{"task_id": "Mbpp/626", "solution": "def triangle_area(radius: float) -> float | None:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the area of the largest triangle inscribed in a semicircle.\n\n    Returns None for non-positive radii, otherwise returns the calculated area.\n    \"\"\"\n    if radius <= 0:\n        return None\n    else:\n        # The largest triangle has its base as the diameter (2*radius) and height as the radius.\n        # Area = 0.5 * base * height = 0.5 * (2 * radius) * radius = radius * radius.\n        area = radius * radius\n        return float(area)"}
