{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(array: list, k: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Reverses the first k elements of an array in-place.\n    Returns the modified array.\n    \"\"\"\n    left = 0\n    # The effective end index for reversal, clamped by the array's length.\n    right = min(k, len(array)) - 1\n\n    while left < right:\n        array[left], array[right] = array[right], array[left]\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n    return array"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/631", "solution": "def replace_spaces(input: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Swaps whitespace characters with underscores and vice versa in the input string.\n    Uses a temporary character to ensure correct bidirectional replacement.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Replace spaces with a unique temporary character (null character).\n    temp_char = '\\x00'\n    modified_string = input.replace(' ', temp_char)\n\n    # Replace underscores with spaces.\n    modified_string = modified_string.replace('_', ' ')\n\n    # Replace the temporary character with underscores.\n    modified_string = modified_string.replace(temp_char, '_')\n\n    return modified_string"}
