{"task_id": "Mbpp/752", "solution": "def jacobsthal_num(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth Jacobsthal number.\n    The function accepts a non-negative integer index `n`.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    else:\n        a, b = 0, 1  # Represents J(k-2) and J(k-1)\n        # Iteratively calculate J(k) = J(k-1) + 2 * J(k-2)\n        for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n            a, b = b, b + 2 * a\n        return b"}
