{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "def find_min_diff(numbers: tuple, length: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the minimum absolute difference between any two elements in a tuple.\n    It sorts the tuple to efficiently find the minimum difference between adjacent elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_numbers = sorted(numbers)\n    min_diff = float('inf')\n\n    for i in range(length - 1):\n        current_diff = abs(sorted_numbers[i+1] - sorted_numbers[i])\n        min_diff = min(min_diff, current_diff)\n\n    return min_diff"}
