{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(arr: list, target: object) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the last position (index) of a target element in a sorted array.\n    Returns the 0-based index or -1 if the target is not found.\"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(arr) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            low = mid + 1  # Try to find a later occurrence in the right half\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:  # arr[mid] > target\n            high = mid - 1\n    return result"}
