{"task_id": "Mbpp/806", "solution": "def find_max_run_uppercase(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the maximum run of uppercase ASCII characters (A-Z) in a string.\n    Returns 0 if the string is empty or contains no uppercase characters.\"\"\"\n    current_run = 0\n    max_run = 0\n\n    for char in input_string:\n        # Check if the character is an uppercase ASCII letter.\n        if 'A' <= char <= 'Z':\n            current_run += 1\n        else:\n            current_run = 0\n        max_run = max(max_run, current_run)\n\n    return max_run"}
